$ pace project init   # at 09:00 in work/webshop
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the project `webshop` (Webshop relaunch), not billable.
Wrote the project's ID into .pace.toml and removed its name, which the record holds.
pace took these defaults: name `Webshop relaunch` from the manifest, no client, no role and not billable, as it has no client; `pace project edit webshop` changes them.

